                    "level": {
                      "value": 6
                    },
                    "description": {
                      "value": "In nature, certain animals are covered in venomous spines, such that even touching them is deadly. To use this reaction, you must have brushed poison onto your clothing or woven sharp poisoned needles into the garment's fabric. This takes 10 minutes and uses one dose of contact or injury poison. You can have only one such poison suffused into your clothing at a time.\n\nWhen you use this reaction, the triggering creature is exposed to the suffused poison."
